BSIM4 4.8.3 transient NQS (TRNQSMOD 1) and CAPMOD 0/1 switching
* Coverage: .tran of three inverters driven by the same edge: one with
* the transient NQS charge node (TRNQSMOD 1: the `charge` internal node,
* qcheq/qcdump states), one with CAPMOD 0 and one with CAPMOD 1 and
* XPART 0.5. .options compat=spice3.
* Model cards: compact 0.18 um-class BSIM4 4.8.3 cards written for the
* Dune regression decks (values chosen for these tests, not taken from
* any PDK). Golden: ngspice-47 (Homebrew).
.options compat=spice3
vdd vdd 0 dc 1.8
vin in 0 pulse(0 1.8 0.1n 40p 40p 0.5n 1.2n)
mn1 o1 in 0 0 nnqs l=0.5u w=2u ad=1p as=1p pd=5u ps=5u
mp1 o1 in vdd vdd pch l=0.18u w=2u ad=1p as=1p pd=5u ps=5u
mn2 o2 in 0 0 ncap0 l=0.18u w=1u ad=0.5p as=0.5p pd=3u ps=3u
mp2 o2 in vdd vdd pch l=0.18u w=2u ad=1p as=1p pd=5u ps=5u
mn3 o3 in 0 0 ncap1 l=0.18u w=1u ad=0.5p as=0.5p pd=3u ps=3u
mp3 o3 in vdd vdd pch l=0.18u w=2u ad=1p as=1p pd=5u ps=5u
c1 o1 0 5f
c2 o2 0 5f
c3 o3 0 5f
.tran 4p 2.4n
.model nnqs nmos level=54 version=4.8.3
+ binunit=1 paramchk=1 mobmod=0 capmod=2 igcmod=0 igbmod=0 geomod=0 diomod=1
+ rdsmod=0 rbodymod=0 rgatemod=0 permod=1 acnqsmod=0 trnqsmod=0 tempmod=0
+ fnoimod=1 tnoimod=0 tnom=27
+ toxe=4.1e-9 toxp=3.4e-9 toxm=4.1e-9 dtox=0.7e-9 epsrox=3.9
+ wint=5e-9 lint=1e-8 ll=0 wl=0 lln=1 wln=1 lw=0 ww=0 lwn=1 wwn=1 lwl=0 wwl=0
+ xl=0 xw=0 dlc=1.5e-8 dwc=0 xpart=0
+ vth0=0.42 k1=0.55 k2=-0.02 k3=1.5 k3b=0.5 w0=2.5e-6 dvt0=1.1 dvt1=0.55
+ dvt2=-0.03 dvt0w=0.1 dvt1w=5.3e6 dvt2w=-0.032 dsub=0.3 minv=0.05 voffl=0
+ dvtp0=1e-10 dvtp1=0.1 lpe0=6e-8 lpeb=1e-9 xj=1.5e-7 ngate=1e23 ndep=2.5e17
+ nsd=1e20 phin=0 cdsc=2.4e-4 cdscb=0 cdscd=0 cit=0 voff=-0.09 nfactor=1.2
+ eta0=0.08 etab=-0.05 u0=0.032 ua=1.0e-9 ub=1.5e-18 uc=5e-11 eu=1.67
